      "statement": "coefficients.ts seeds one ExerciseDef per movement pattern with coefficient 1.0 marked isReference, and every other exercise in that pattern carries a coefficient expressing its strength relative to that reference lift in e1RM units; these are rough population priors intended to self-correct per user via Bayesian shrinkage.",
