      "statement": "recommend() predicts an exercise's e1RM as pattern_strength * effectiveCoefficient(exercise), where estimatePatternStrength pools every logged variant in the pattern (each contributing variant_e1RM / its_effective_coefficient, weighted by 1 + min(confidenceN, 5)) into one latent pattern-strength number per user per pattern.",
