      "id": "claim_e24d749c3d6448f38882d139d17ca9c6",
      "statement": "selectProgressionReference bounds the progression comparison window using the latest same-program-slot exposure as an anchor: with a same-slot exposure, candidates are every performance for the exact exercise at or after that timestamp across slots/days; with none, the four most recent exposures are used; ties favor recency and a performance with no computable e1RM falls back to recency comparison rather than being treated as comparable.",
